# Minimal .sgdignore for delta deployments
# Only ignore what truly cannot be deployed

# Salesforce Internal/Managed Permission Sets
**/permissionsets/sfdcInternalInt__*
**/permissionsets/force__*

# SAML and Security
**/samlssoconfigs/**

# System metadata
**/appMenus/**
**/installedPackages/**

# Experience Cloud
# Network metadata cannot be retrieved by the CLI, so every Network-dependent
# component (sites, navigation menus, digital experiences) would fail to
# deploy. Tracked in source control, excluded from the deployment payload only.
**/sites/**
**/navigationMenus/**
**/digitalExperienceConfigs/**
**/digitalExperiences/**
